NegroniMetal changes to the ios-flame 745c434 Metal frontend (MIT), on top of 0001-0003:
- CAMetalLayer drawable presentation support on NBCommandBuffer:
  presentDrawable:, presentDrawable:atTime:, presentDrawable:afterMinimumDuration:, presentDrawable:options:,
  addPresentedHandler:, presentedHandlers. Drawables are presented in -finish, unblocking the compositor/layer.
- Descriptor variants for command encoders: computeCommandEncoderWithDescriptor:, blitCommandEncoderWithDescriptor:.
- NBTexture: isDrawable, numFaces, isCompressed, formattedDescription:.
- Tolerance for compute pipelines and dispatches (like render pipelines/draws): a refused or nil compute pipeline
  skips dispatches instead of failing the command buffer.
- Tolerance for tile shaders in NBRenderEncoder: log skipped instead of failing command buffer.

